### Background
Fix https://github.com/Shopify/app-ui/issues/2211

### 🎩

1. Follow this [doc](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1kdqif_HgyH_rZi6prY8p1YbvdrtJZ6lZH-zGGhGWu-o/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.1f3xod8i38e6) to create a block extension
2. Open the package.json of the extension and update to use the `0.0.0-snapshot-20250421182514` snapshot with the fixed types. Note that the types for the snapshot was generated with this [PR](https://github.com/Shopify/admin-ui-foundations/pull/2613) for building individual d.ts files for each component.
3. Run `pnpm install` to install the snapshot
4. Update your extension code to be as follows:
```tsx
import {render} from 'preact';
export default function extension() {
  render(<Extension />, document.body);
}

function Extension() {
  return (
    <s-admin-block title="My Block Extension">
      <s-form onSubmit={(event) => {
        event.waitUntil((async () => {
          console.log('saving');
          close();
        })());
      }}>
      <s-button onClick={(event) => {
        console.log('clicked', event);
      }}>Test button</s-button>
      </s-form>
    </s-admin-block>
  );
}
```
5. Verify that you get the event typed as either `Event` for the Button onClick handler
<img width="544" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/325464c2-a691-4a23-a413-4f15b84b4375" />
7. Verify that you get the event typed as `ExtendableEvent` for the Form onSubmit handler
<img width="538" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/571a6da5-9e98-4686-acd5-fae4d492e681" />


