I was just helping a camper confused by the code they passed the challenge with

```css
html {
  box-sizing: inherit;
}

*, ::before, ::after {
  box-sizing: inherit;
}
```

I have added tests to make sure that the `html` selector would still have the `box-sizing` value for the property.

I am not sure for the order of the tests, but it made sense to add them.
